 (name "CUI PJ-102AH (for MEAN WELL GST60A12)")
 (description "PCB jack that mates with the MEAN WELL GST60A12-P1J 12 V / 5 A adapter (5.5 x 2.1 mm plug, centre positive). PJ-102AH is rated 2.5 A - fine for a keyboard/display load; if you ever need the full 5 A use a higher-current jack. Not needed at all if the adapter plugs straight into the Metro RP2350 DC jack.")
